various times throughout the history of the galaxy, either as a direct influence, an indirect influence, or a simple observer. Using his esper abilities, Locke can learn and do most things more quickly than a normal human. His power also allows him to remain eternally young, or even turn himself into a child again to be adopted by kind-hearted families. It is speculated he remains youthful as an excuse not to take responsibility for whatever cause he is approached for, since no one expects youths to have such responsibilities.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Matriarchy","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Terrorism","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Adoption","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Brainwashing","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"CGI","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Locke the Superman","english":"Locke the Superman","native":"超人ロック","romaji":"Choujin Locke","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"超人洛克"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"超人ロック～魔女の世紀～"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}